{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1000_p", "source_sha256": "87a335ccacd4b6fc663975fb422befffcffac77568297ed645848ffa2e2cd248", "ja": "（今日は『三匹の子豚』がテーマのドラマ撮影。\n紗代子たちの出演シーンは無事に撮り終わった……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "bdd621a442552b06ea30511f00955241c082c9f69c6beb970e0ff3e99d0e3136", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1002_p", "source_sha256": "678bb1debc79cd45ae6e74177d36280c54788022f9b20648ea017fb55776a067", "ja": "お疲れ様。今日の撮影、すごくよかったよ！\nみんなの息もピッタリ合ってたな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "e87dd915d5439344d7d2921ac037728b46753f2062d641dc228c7536481bef76", "ja": "本当ですか？　よかった……。\n今日に向けて、みんなでたくさん練習しましたから。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3417586303bcd15252cdaa93ce6f7bf723c8265424988c32fec2136240f3a606", "ja": "ああ。みんなも気合いが入ってたな。\n特に紗代子は一番気合いが入ってなかったか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "3bfcac4d5ffc1ae1a77a7da8fa00a6d279c8f7041b3caaf48c3917ae7368a76c", "ja": "えっと。実は、初めてこの台本を読んだ時、\nすごく嬉しくなったんです。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "eadbcd98b035a0845f30e5b9b75a2d60d41f1b34f305e0b27657d21513a2005d", "ja": "小さい頃に想像していた内容と同じだ……って！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1007_p", "source_sha256": "9187d7dc51e8a35795ff9cd2443dc59722921a8a003c4b7fe2a91b5b7b44314f", "ja": "想像していたって？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "28de849531a56b91f605fe4b96dadb0af3a939cecfc88b29b25de6901d3604f0", "ja": "絵本だと、オオカミは悪い子で、\n最後は末っ子のブタが、山へ追い払うお話でした。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "4ff0611e94414dce7cc4048b3556d8e6227bf96212eda2c0eadbc2f1c49a663d", "ja": "でも、ずっと思ってたんです……。何とかみんなで、\n仲良くすることはできなかったのかなって。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1010_p", "source_sha256": "40d183c1a7cb5d63d2b6bd3cb706bd67a511db39f61527941ed14ba2131732e2", "ja": "なるほど、今回のドラマと同じだな。\n紗代子は、その頃から優しかったんだな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "d1edcc41163c6628a0a09ca113f43b57eb983f0a48811f877b22c932905b7dd7", "ja": "い、いえ、そんな……！\nみんなが仲よくすれば、楽しいのにって思っただけで。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "7ecde9b03d75f8b9f6b873c01a4693b4910e274744e5f00a6e422b6b24435781", "ja": "だからこそ、このお話が嬉しかったんです。\nなんだか、夢が叶ったみたいで。それに……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "f88fc7d01271361ac40f4f0110ece1cdb453e9aaade9b34d45f12a87b91e23f7", "ja": "オオカミ役の環ちゃん！　すごく可愛かったですよね♪\nあんなオオカミさんを追い払うなんてできません！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2f68d8864f7ccb410fdab546ea9e10f38a907a6f9250a24530571ca910e1f7b2", "ja": "はは、確かに。ファンのみんなも、\n紗代子と同じことを思いながら見るだろうな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1015_027say", "source_sha256": "89ca00032ffb1e2dcb08c932df9f308944ecb13aa8acca5e4084297317871c4e", "ja": "ふふっ、そうですね。昔話の『三匹の子豚』とは、\n全然違うエンディングですけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0693_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0693_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "e49d6f72dd070b023b3dd676256e524b36afc5a923abf7f7fc940eddfe0f9a44", "ja": "このお話も、きっと楽しんでもらえるはずです！\n私たちの絆で、とっても素敵な作品になりましたから♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
